---
import SiteLayout from '../../components/SiteLayout.astro';
import { findPost } from '../../data/blog';

const post = findPost('before-there-was-upala')!;
---

<SiteLayout
  title={`${post.title} — Songdance`}
  description={post.excerpt}
  image={post.hero}
  imageAlt={post.heroAlt}
>
  <article class="bp">
    <header class="bp-head">
      <p class="sd-eyebrow">Journal · The story behind the journey</p>
      <h1 class="bp-title">Before any of this, there was <em class="lyric">Upala</em>.</h1>
      <p class="bp-lede">
        How the Authentic Singing Journey began — with no money, a borrowed year, and the voice of
        the person who started it all.
      </p>
      <p class="bp-byline">
        <time datetime={post.date}>{post.dateLabel}</time>
        <span class="bp-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {post.readingMinutes} min read
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="bp-hero">
      <img src={post.hero} alt={post.heroAlt} fetchpriority="high" />
    </figure>

    <div class="bp-body">
      <p>
        The Authentic Singing Journey will always have a special place in my heart. So let me tell
        you how it began.
      </p>
      <p>
        Upala — my late wife — was recovering from the surgery that saved her life after her brain
        tumour. The doctors had given her one year. She didn't want to spend it resting. She wanted
        to travel, and to share the power of authentic singing with the world.
      </p>
      <p>We had no money left in the bank. And I had never recorded anything like this before.</p>
      <p>
        This was before Covid. There weren't many online programs combining music and guided
        sessions back then. It was new — to me, and to the first people who signed up.
      </p>
      <p>
        I remember the self-doubt. Will this work? Will people believe me when I say
        <em class="lyric">much love to you</em> at the end of a session? Will the music be good
        enough? Will anyone actually pay for this?
      </p>

      <figure class="bp-figure">
        <img
          src="/media/library/jacob-upala-singing.webp"
          alt="Jacob and Upala sounding together in a candle-lit cave while making the first recordings"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Authentic singing in a cave — where the first recordings were made.</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p>
        For those first recordings, Upala almost literally held my hand while I spoke into the mic
        and played.
      </p>
      <p>
        And then we did start travelling. And people did sign up. And they loved it. First came the
        Dutch program, and later the English one. Our community grew from tens of people to
        thousands, all over the world, discovering their own authentic voices.
      </p>
      <p>
        As the months passed, Upala grew stronger, lighter, full of purpose. So we kept going
        further. A community member in South Africa reached out and invited us to hold retreats
        there. So we went.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="bp-pull">
        <p>She mostly just taught by being. By living.</p>
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        It grew into something I'm still proud of — forty weeks in Dutch, then another forty in
        English, one session a week. Not a quick course; a slow path you walk a week at a time.
      </p>
      <p>
        And people didn't come to it to learn to sing <em>better</em>. They came, week by week, and
        met the voice they'd quietened somewhere along the way — not a prettier voice, an honest one.
      </p>
      <p>
        Music and guided sessions, woven together, at your own pace, in your own room, for as long as
        you need them. I still haven't found anything quite like it. Don't expect miracles from it;
        expect a real relationship with your own voice.
      </p>
      <p>And of course, other programs followed. But that's a story for another day.</p>

      <p class="bp-signoff">With love,<br />Jacob</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="bp-cta">
      <p class="sd-eyebrow">The journey it became</p>
      <h2 class="bp-cta-head">Forty weeks with your own <em class="lyric">voice.</em></h2>
      <p class="bp-cta-body">
        Self-paced, at home, begin anytime — the journey Upala and I started, still going, still
        finding voices that had gone quiet.
      </p>
      <a href="/courses/authentic-singing" class="bp-cta-btn">
        Discover the Authentic Singing Journey
        <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </aside>

    <nav class="bp-back">
      <a href="/blog"><i class="ph-light ph-arrow-left"></i> All journal entries</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .bp {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .bp-head {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sp-9) var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.2vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-display);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: var(--sp-4) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  /* Typography law: Cormorant italic reads small inside Spectral display — bump it. */
  .bp-title em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.05em;
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  .bp-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.6vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 36ch;
    margin: var(--sp-5) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .bp-byline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-caption);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-quiet);
    margin: var(--sp-5) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
  }
  .bp-byline .bp-dot {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink-whisper);
  }

  /* ---------- Hero image ---------- */
  .bp-hero {
    max-width: var(--container);
    margin: var(--sp-6) auto 0;
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-hero img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    filter: var(--sd-img-filter);
  }

  /* ---------- Body ---------- */
  .bp-body {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sp-7) var(--sp-6) 0;
  }
  .bp-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-prose);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  /* Plain emphasis stays in the body italic (no lyric swap → no bump needed). */
  .bp-body em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  /* A deliberate lyric flourish — swaps to Cormorant, so it must be sized up. */
  .bp-body em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.25em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }

  .bp-figure {
    margin: var(--sp-7) 0;
  }
  .bp-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    filter: var(--sd-img-filter);
  }
  .bp-figure figcaption {
    margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink-quiet);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .bp-pull {
    margin: var(--sp-7) 0;
    padding: var(--sp-1) 0 var(--sp-1) var(--sp-5);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ember);
  }
  .bp-pull p {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .bp-body p.bp-signoff {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: var(--sp-7);
  }

  /* ---------- Closing CTA ---------- */
  .bp-cta {
    max-width: var(--container-narrow);
    margin: var(--sp-8) auto 0;
    padding: var(--sp-7) var(--sp-6);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
  }
  .bp-cta-head {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--t-h2);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .bp-cta-head em.lyric {
    font-family: var(--font-lyric);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.05em;
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }
  .bp-cta-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-body);
    line-height: var(--lh-prose);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: var(--sp-4) 0 0;
    max-width: 48ch;
  }
  .bp-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
    background: var(--ember-deep);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    transition: background var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--plum);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn i {
    font-size: 17px;
    transition: transform var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-cta-btn:hover i {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  /* ---------- Back link ---------- */
  .bp-back {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: var(--sp-7) auto var(--sp-9);
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .bp-back a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .bp-back a:hover {
    color: var(--ember-deep);
  }
  .bp-back i {
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: transform var(--d-base) var(--ease);
  }
  .bp-back a:hover i {
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .bp-head {
      padding: var(--sp-8) var(--sp-5) var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-hero {
      padding: 0 var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-body {
      padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-5) 0;
    }
    .bp-cta {
      padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-5);
      margin-left: var(--sp-5);
      margin-right: var(--sp-5);
    }
    .bp-back {
      padding: 0 var(--sp-5);
    }
  }
</style>
